# Intelligent Documentation Platform - Build Plan
## CrisPRO.ai AI-Powered Documentation Experience

**Vision:** Create a next-generation documentation platform that goes beyond traditional docs - an intelligent, interactive, beautiful experience powered by AI agents that can understand context, answer questions, and guide users through our platform capabilities.

---

## 🎯 CORE PHILOSOPHY

### What We're NOT Building
- ❌ Traditional sidebar + markdown docs
- ❌ Static content pages
- ❌ Boring technical documentation
- ❌ Simple search functionality

### What We ARE Building
- ✅ **Intelligent Knowledge Experience** - AI understands context and guides users
- ✅ **Interactive API Explorer** - Live, visual API testing with real-time results
- ✅ **Conversational Documentation** - Ask questions, get intelligent answers
- ✅ **Dynamic Content from CMS** - Hygraph-powered, always up-to-date
- ✅ **Beautiful, Immersive UI** - Not docs, an experience
- ✅ **Modular Architecture** - Reusable components, easy to extend

